; Correlation coefficient, CC (unitless) — authored for this project over
; the conventional 0.2..1.05 NWS-style dual-pol display range. Not sourced
; from a specific published GRLevelX palette — see ADR-0021's verification
; note. Low CC (non-meteorological: debris, chaff, biota) is red/orange;
; high CC (~1.0, uniform precipitation) is green; the narrow band just below
; 1.0, where a tornadic debris signature typically sits, gets the finest
; steps.
Product: Cc
Units: (unitless)
Step: 0.05
SolidColor: 0.20 200   0   0
SolidColor: 0.50 230 100   0
SolidColor: 0.70 230 200   0
SolidColor: 0.80 200 230   0
SolidColor: 0.90 120 220   0
SolidColor: 0.95  40 200  40
SolidColor: 0.98  20 160 120
SolidColor: 1.00   0 120 200
SolidColor: 1.03  60  60  60
RF: 160 160 160
ND: 0 0 0 0
